<title>BELGIUM: Agridec '96 profit jumps, upbeat on H1 '97.</title>
<headline>Agridec '96 profit jumps, upbeat on H1 '97.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs, unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit	  30.88  vs   7.19</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain	31.96  vs    n/a</p>
<p>    Gross dividend(francs)     35  vs     30</p>
<p>NOTE - Agridec is a Belgian property and investment company.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it booked a &quot;significant&quot; capital gain in February which should lift first-half 1997 results.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 771</p>
